There are basically three ways to use a diskette under OSF/1:

1. Use newfs to create a ufs file system on the raw device
	 (usually whole disk, rrz#c), then mount the character device;

2. Use tar to read/write the raw device;

3. Use the mtools family of commands to read/write MSDOS
	 compatible diskettes (mtools can be found on the Alpha
	 Freeware CD, et.al.)

Cheers Steffen.


