This is a simple thing, I want the system to prompt for root password
when it comes up single-user, for reasons that are easy to imagine.

Analyzing the boot-up scripts leads to a strange paradox.  Looking at
/etc/inittab for runstate "S" the only thing called is "/sbin/rc0
