It is an include file relating to the new "db" database type. The db
library is not something that you have on your system by default. If
you want to use it then you need to get the sources for it and build it
before you build sendmail.

If you don't want to use the new fangled database type then edit the
relevent Makefile and remove "-DNEWDB" from the "DBMDEF=" line and
"-ldb" from the "LIBS=" line.

